Subject: [PATCH 21/24] Render a working indicator in the hermes-vps pane
 during in-flight turns

The pane has no composer or spinner, so a slow-but-genuinely-working turn
looked identical to a dead session. Print a bare [working...] line on
message.start, the earliest signal the existing event stream offers.
